From 4037f6e4c942a30cca5194dedcecc93400a1dfa2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 04:34:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs: add Wasmer Edge deploy option

Add a README deploy note and a root Staticfile (root: target) so Wasmer's static build serves Astro's configured outDir instead of the default dist.
---
 README.md  | 4 ++++
 Staticfile | 1 +
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 Staticfile

diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 4ac4b08..3182fee 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -56,6 +56,10 @@ $ bun install
 $ bun run start
 ```
 
+## Deploy
+
+`bun run build` writes the static site to `target/`, and the root `Staticfile` points Wasmer at that directory. To host it on Wasmer Edge, [import the repository on Wasmer](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=alxshelepenok%2Flumen). The link imports this public repository for a build and does not copy it into your GitHub account, so import your own fork or copy instead if you want to customize the blog and redeploy on push.
+
 ## Sponsors
 
 Special thanks to our sponsors and partners for supporting the project.
diff --git a/Staticfile b/Staticfile
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..7a199f0
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Staticfile
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+root: target
-- 
2.43.0

